If you want access to the devel version of Bioconductor, you should be
using the devel version of R and use biocLite.  Technically,
installing from a devel tarball to a release version of R is sometimes
feasible, sometimes not and almost always a recipe for later problems
(as many people on the email list have found out).

Kasper

