Hi Frank,
getting back your question on splice index in oneChannelGUI
I checked the code and, since exon probe sets and gene probe sets are 
log2 transformed in oneChannelGUI,
the splice index is given by the difference between the log2 
transformation of the intensities:

log2(exon intensity) - log2(transcript intensity) = 2.55863 - 4.47946 = 
-1.92083


Cheers
Raffaele

