Bioconductor devel.  The package is an implementation of a method for
normalizing RNA-Seq data, represented in a region (gene/exon) by
sample matrix.  The methodology is described in the following
preprint:

Hansen, K.D., Irizarry, R.A. & Wu, Z. Removing technical variability
in rna-seq data using conditional quantile normalization. Johns
Hopkins University, Dept of Biostatistics Working Papers, 227 (2011).
http://www.bepress.com/jhubiostat/paper227

Kasper Daniel Hansen, Rafael Irizarry and Zhijin (Jean) Wu


